{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01T7kLbGJTGWtSrHGBaFupsV","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Y6g6Wram3k6Mr9yHpyVcT2","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/Users/vanderlei/vans/wtm/.chief/prds/main/progress.md","old_string":"  - YAML unmarshal into a struct with nil map needs a nil check after unmarshal\n---","new_string":"  - YAML unmarshal into a struct with nil map needs a nil check after unmarshal\n---\n\n## 2026-03-05 - US-002\n- Implemented `devtree register <domain> --port <port>` CLI command\n- Created `cmd/devtree/` package with `main.go`, `root.go`, `register.go`\n- Register loads routes.yaml, calls `table.Register()`, saves atomically, prints confirmation\n- Supports `--meta key=value` flags (repeatable) for arbitrary metadata\n- Attempts Unix socket reload (best-effort, silently ignored if daemon not running)\n- Files changed: `cmd/devtree/main.go`, `cmd/devtree/root.go`, `cmd/devtree/register.go`\n- **Learnings for future iterations:**\n  - `defer conn.Close()` must be `defer func() { _ = conn.Close() }()` for errcheck\n  - devtree CLI uses cobra, same as wtm CLI but in separate `cmd/devtree/` package\n  - `DefaultRoutesPath()` and `DefaultSocketPath()` are in `root.go` for reuse by other subcommands\n---"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":197,"cache_read_input_tokens":34198,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":197},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b7a4c6f5-9694-4de0-bf06-00f30709f32b","uuid":"7d42d900-ce5d-4830-b1f9-e7557bb30aed"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Y6g6Wram3k6Mr9yHpyVcT2","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /Users/vanderlei/vans/wtm/.chief/prds/main/progress.md has been updated successfully."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b7a4c6f5-9694-4de0-bf06-00f30709f32b","uuid":"0a9189a0-6013-4bf8-b756-86ff45723819","tool_use_result":{"filePath":"/Users/vanderlei/vans/wtm/.chief/prds/main/progress.md","oldString":"  - YAML unmarshal into a struct with nil map needs a nil check after unmarshal\n---","newString":"  - YAML unmarshal into a struct with nil map needs a nil check after unmarshal\n---\n\n## 2026-03-05 - US-002\n- Implemented `devtree register <domain> --port <port>` CLI command\n- Created `cmd/devtree/` package with `main.go`, `root.go`, `register.go`\n- Register loads routes.yaml, calls `table.Register()`, saves atomically, prints confirmation\n- Supports `--meta key=value` flags (repeatable) for arbitrary metadata\n- Attempts Unix socket reload (best-effort, silently ignored if daemon not running)\n- Files changed: `cmd/devtree/main.go`, `cmd/devtree/root.go`, `cmd/devtree/register.go`\n- **Learnings for future iterations:**\n  - `defer conn.Close()` must be `defer func() { _ = conn.Close() }()` for errcheck\n  - devtree CLI uses cobra, same as wtm CLI but in separate `cmd/devtree/` package\n  - `DefaultRoutesPath()` and `DefaultSocketPath()` are in `root.go` for reuse by other subcommands\n---","originalFile":"## Codebase Patterns\n- Use `gopkg.in/yaml.v3` for YAML marshaling/unmarshaling\n- Pre-commit hook runs `golangci-lint` — must use `_ =` for intentionally ignored error returns (errcheck)\n- Atomic file writes: use `os.CreateTemp` + `os.Rename` pattern\n- Module path: `github.com/vansdevcode/worktree-manager`\n- Existing CLI is `cmd/wtm/`, new devtree CLI goes in `cmd/devtree/`\n- Config dir convention: `~/.config/devtree/` for routing state files\n\n## 2026-03-05 - US-001\n- Implemented `internal/routing` package with routing table YAML state file\n- Types: `Table` (holds `Sites` map), `Site` (Upstream string, Meta map)\n- Functions: `Load(path)`, `Save(path, table)` with atomic write (temp + rename)\n- Methods: `Register`, `Unregister`, `Get`, `List` (sorted alphabetically)\n- Files changed: `internal/routing/routing.go`, `internal/routing/routing_test.go`\n- **Learnings for future iterations:**\n  - golangci-lint errcheck requires `_ =` prefix for intentionally ignored error returns in cleanup paths\n  - `gopkg.in/yaml.v3` is already in go.sum, no need to `go get` it\n  - YAML unmarshal into a struct with nil map needs a nil check after unmarshal\n---\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":17,"oldLines":3,"newStart":17,"newLines":16,"lines":["   - `gopkg.in/yaml.v3` is already in go.sum, no need to `go get` it","   - YAML unmarshal into a struct with nil map needs a nil check after unmarshal"," ---","+","+## 2026-03-05 - US-002","+- Implemented `devtree register <domain> --port <port>` CLI command","+- Created `cmd/devtree/` package with `main.go`, `root.go`, `register.go`","+- Register loads routes.yaml, calls `table.Register()`, saves atomically, prints confirmation","+- Supports `--meta key=value` flags (repeatable) for arbitrary metadata","+- Attempts Unix socket reload (best-effort, silently ignored if daemon not running)","+- Files changed: `cmd/devtree/main.go`, `cmd/devtree/root.go`, `cmd/devtree/register.go`","+- **Learnings for future iterations:**","+  - `defer conn.Close()` must be `defer func() { _ = conn.Close() }()` for errcheck","+  - devtree CLI uses cobra, same as wtm CLI but in separate `cmd/devtree/` package","+  - `DefaultRoutesPath()` and `DefaultSocketPath()` are in `root.go` for reuse by other subcommands","+---"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false}}
