.Println(\"Next steps:\")\n\tfmt.Println(\"  1. Run: devtree start\")\n\tfmt.Println(\"  2. Register a service: devtree register myapp.test --port 8080\")\n\tfmt.Println(\"  3. Open: https://myapp.test\")\n}\n"}}
